WEBVTT

00:00:00.115 --> 00:00:06.087
Academic year and terms

00:00:06.137 --> 00:00:09.061
Open Management, then Sessions.

00:00:13.802 --> 00:00:18.051
On the Academic Years tab, press Add Academic Year.

00:00:19.816 --> 00:00:24.290
Enter a name, a start date and an end date, then save.

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:38.838
Press Set Current to make it the active year.

00:00:41.654 --> 00:00:44.877
Now open the Terms tab and press Add Term.

00:00:46.803 --> 00:00:52.616
Enter the term name, type, dates and order. Repeat for every term.

00:01:04.447 --> 00:01:10.646
Your academic year is ready
